From 381ce31eb31b86b0f4892967292af54001543f15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: At30c <PabloAtsoc9993@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 22:15:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Restore F415F FM checkBaseFreq JNI contract

The stock F415F libfmradio_jni.so registers checkBaseFreq()Z, while the
Android 17 donor framework no longer declares it. ART aborts system_server
when Settings loads FMSettingSearchProvider because RegisterNatives cannot
resolve the method.

Restore the single declaration required by the target JNI library.
---
 .../com/android/server/FMPlayerNative.smali                 | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali_classes6/com/android/server/FMPlayerNative.smali b/smali_classes6/com/android/server/FMPlayerNative.smali
index a7aa837..ef9ddbe 100644
--- a/smali_classes6/com/android/server/FMPlayerNative.smali
+++ b/smali_classes6/com/android/server/FMPlayerNative.smali
@@ -238,6 +238,9 @@
 .method public native blacklist cancelSeek()V
 .end method
 
+.method public native blacklist checkBaseFreq()Z
+.end method
+
 .method public native blacklist disableAF()V
 .end method
 
